    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Change the past, create the future -</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A novel game about changing the past and creating the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would the present be like if you could remove the regrets of that time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewrite the book that contains your past and create the future you never had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive real time in the adventure part, and relive past events in the novel part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also improve your novel to realize your regrets of that time and hope for a better future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u201cHaraPeko club\u201d has finally released a new type of ADV that rewrites and improves novels from the past.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Change the past, create the future -</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A novel game about changing the past and creating the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would the present be like if you could remove the regrets of that time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewrite the book that contains your past and create the future you never had.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive real time in the adventure part, and relive past events in the novel part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also improve your novel to realize your regrets of that time and hope for a better future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The \u201cHaraPeko club\u201d has finally released a new type of ADV that rewrites and improves novels from the past.</p>",
    "short_description": "-Change the past, create the future - A novel game about changing the past. What would the present be like if you could remove the regrets of that time? Rewrite the book that contains your past and create the future that you could not get. A new sensation ADV is now available from HaraPeko club.",
